t=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a>, including the Crystal Column chambers in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai%2FInner%20Sanctum\">Inner Sanctum</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tChases you quickly and fights until death. Behaviour similar to a stronger <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a>.<br/><br/>A draken elite attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tFirst of all, try to stay diagonal all the time, because his wave is very strong. Mages should use Ice-Based spells, while Paladins should use Crystalline Arrow/Prismatic Bolts and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Spear\">Ethereal Spear</a>. It's a hard creature for <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>, and one should use a weapon combined with <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> based spells all the time to kill it fast.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on February 25, 2025, the patch changed its XP from 4,200 to 4,750.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Dro